      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 其所持有的关于该主体的个人信息或个人信息的类型；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 89.38880920410156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 上述个人信息的来源、所用于的目的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 104.98878479003906,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 已经获得上述个人信息的第三方身份或类型。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 122.12898254394531,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注：个人信息主体提出查询非其主动提供的个人信息时，个人信息控制者可在综合考虑不响应请求可",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 137.7289581298828,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "能对个人信息主体合法权益带来的风险和损害，以及技术可行性、实现请求的成本等因素后，作",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 153.32899475097656,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "出是否响应的决定，并给出解释说明。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 175.98895263671875,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8.2 个人信息更正",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 199.09658813476562,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "个人信息主体发现个人信息控制者所持有的该主体的个人信息有错误或不完整的，",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 214.69662475585938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "个人信息控制者应为其提供请求更正或补充信息的方法。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 238.388916015625,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8.3 个人信息删除",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 261.4966125488281,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 276.6187744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 符合以下情形，个人信息主体要求删除的，应及时删除个人信息：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 292.21875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "1) 个人信息控制者违反法律法规规定，收集、使用个人信息的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 307.81878662109375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "2) 个人信息控制者违反与个人信息主体的约定，收集、使用个人信息的。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 323.41876220703125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 个人信息控制者违反法律法规规定或违反与个人信息主体的约定向第三方共",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 339.526611328125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "享、转让个人信息，且个人信息主体要求删除的，个人信息控制者应立即停止",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 354.7733459472656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "共享、转让的行为，并通知第三方及时删除；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 370.2187805175781,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 个人信息控制者违反法律法规规定或违反与个人信息主体的约定，公开披露个",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 386.3266296386719,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "人信息，且个人信息主体要求删除的，个人信息控制者应立即停止公开披露的",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 401.5733337402344,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "行为，并发布通知要求相关接收方删除相应的信息。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 425.6189270019531,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8.4 个人信息主体撤回授权同意",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 448.72662353515625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 463.8387756347656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 应向个人信息主体提供撤回收集、使用其个人信息的授权同意的方法。撤回授",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 479.5933532714844,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "权同意后，个人信息控制者后续不应再处理相应的个人信息；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 495.03875732421875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 应保障个人信息主体拒绝接收基于其个人信息推送商业广告的权利。对外共",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 510.7933654785156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "享、转让、公开披露个人信息，应向个人信息主体提供撤回授权同意的方法。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 527.4910278320312,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注：撤回授权同意不影响撤回前基于授权同意的个人信息处理。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
